---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Stellar Evolution Cheat Sheet | Free Birth, Main Sequence, Death"
  description="Complete stellar evolution cheat sheet with stellar birth, main sequence, and death. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Stellar Evolution<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Stellar birth, main sequence, and death. From protostars to black holes.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Stellar Birth</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Nebula to Protostar</h3>
        <pre><code>Molecular cloud collapses
Conservation of angular momentum
Protostar forms at center
Temperature increases
Nuclear fusion begins when T > 10⁷ K</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Main Sequence</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Hydrogen Burning</h3>
        <pre><code>pp chain: 4H → He + 2e⁺ + 2ν + γ
CNO cycle: catalysed by C, N, O
Luminosity: L ∝ M³.5
Lifetime: τ ∝ M/L ∝ M⁻2.5
Sun: ~10 Gyr on main sequence</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>HR Diagram Position</h3>
        <pre><code>Hot, massive stars: top left
Cool, low-mass stars: bottom right
Main sequence: diagonal band
Stars spend most time on main sequence</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Post-Main Sequence</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Low Mass (< 8 M_sun)</h3>
        <pre><code>Red giant: hydrogen shell burning
Helium flash: triple-alpha process
Asymptotic giant branch
Planetary nebula: outer layers ejected
White dwarf: electron degeneracy
Cools over time</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>High Mass (> 8 M_sun)</h3>
        <pre><code>Supergiant: multiple shell burning
Iron core: fusion stops
Core collapse: supernova
Neutron star: neutron degeneracy
Black hole: if mass > 3 M_sun</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>End States</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Compact Objects</h3>
        <pre><code>White dwarf: M < 1.4 M_sun (Chandrasekhar)
Neutron star: 1.4-3 M_sun
Black hole: M > 3 M_sun (TOV limit)
Pulsar: rotating neutron star
Magnetar: highly magnetized neutron star</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
